{"title":"Saturday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/963043085/0/marginalrevolution~Saturday-assorted-links.html","date":1784997490000,"content":"<p>1. <span>The 1991 Project’s oral history collection (l</span>ed by <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fshreyasnarla&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C8a46db646d834427208d08dee98b5a38%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639204981916914945%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ng0WeHjoDLGJyTpaf1BOUZ1aCI%2FZnmfb%2FaZSjcYbIeY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Shreyas Narla</a> and Shruti) with ~50 hours of interviews with policy reformers and witnesses to India’s market  liberalization, is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fthe1991project.com%2Foral-history&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C8a46db646d834427208d08dee98b5a38%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639204981916968346%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=BtPOYQTSkC0mWIO20K7Kn%2F%2Fif7p2MY8N2psZ4cu0mN4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">now available</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.cato.org/blog/friday-feature-mini-cities\" target=\"_blank\">Mini Cities</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://claude.ai/share/275fbe33-bfd0-4a34-a927-6dc2e36d0522\" target=\"_blank\">The new Claude, on Mondrian</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/hosseeb/status/2080396229536800952?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">More on cybersecurity and cyberdefense</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/22/openai-cyberattack/\" target=\"_blank\">Simon Willison on The Incident</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jon_stokes/status/2080729236013187369\" target=\"_blank\">early AI fears were not about LLMs, and that makes a big difference</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/databallr/status/2080765040853123072\" target=\"_blank\">Critique of the new 76ers</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/yanagizawad/status/2080670638122115462?s=48\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropic economic research futures allocating $200 million to RCTs</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://emily613.substack.com/p/if-you-can-bear-to-hear-the-truth?r=1g4uc&amp;utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=post%20viewer&amp;triedRedirect=true\" target=\"_blank\">Interview with Emily Wilson</a>.  Excellent piece, many of you underrate her.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/saturday-assorted-links-571.html\">Saturday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/963043085/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/963043085/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/963043085/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/963043085/mar